Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.54,0:01:50.69,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,強力凜然振翅高飛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.95,0:02:05.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,像這樣與你相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.09,0:02:11.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,並不是只為了生存下去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.23,0:02:17.81,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,小小的誓言超越時空
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.19,0:02:22.81,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,必定會改變未來的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.46,0:02:26.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,LIMITER　（changing myself）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.31,0:02:29.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,釋放出來　（changing youself）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.57,0:02:35.35,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,迸發吧　天使的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.73,0:02:39.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,拯救世界 「翼」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.31,0:02:42.17,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在選擇的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.35,0:02:48.58,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要抓住夢幻（停不下來）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.68,0:02:51.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,被賦予的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:54.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,向著天空迫近
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.11,0:02:59.90,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,強力凜然振翅高飛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.19,0:03:05.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐　my wings
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.37,0:22:26.08,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,緊緊地抱住逞強的你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.08,0:22:29.03,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就連難過的側臉　全部
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.03,0:22:31.40,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓·人·心·愛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.40,0:22:35.61,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,每打破障壁都會變強的女人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.61,0:22:41.52,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,我的眼·睛　沒有不正常
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.78,0:22:46.78,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,過於率直的心中的情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.78,0:22:50.32,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是不會輸給任何人的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.32,0:22:55.59,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不會放開你　不管在什麼時候
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.59,0:23:00.80,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,這看不到結局的一切　由我來改變
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.80,0:23:05.13,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,惡魔和天使都有翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.13,0:23:10.78,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,指引著前往更高的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.78,0:23:15.46,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,不會再讓你的笑容變得陰沉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.46,0:23:21.88,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連結的希望　現在撕裂了黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.88,0:23:24.82,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,和你一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.04,0:23:30.77,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}向著明天飛躍　Break Your Destiny
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,TEXT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.96,0:00:08.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直美  情況如何
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:10.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有ECM的反應
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.55,0:00:12.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  一口氣衝進去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.11,0:00:19.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到此為止了  諸位犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.99,0:00:23.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早已知道你們躲起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.45,0:00:28.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:39.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休想逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.99,0:00:43.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.67,0:00:45.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.38,0:00:53.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得了  投降  我們投降
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:00.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任務完成
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.31,0:01:02.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.20,0:01:03.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.39,0:01:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼我們要演犯人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.78,0:01:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解犯人那邊的思考也是訓練的一個環節
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.22,0:01:12.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且你們不是也學到了很多東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.53,0:01:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直美的美麗  聰明  氣質
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:20.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  你就如同那居住於湖中的妖精一般
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.92,0:01:23.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飛起來了  飛起來了…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.07,0:01:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到妖精了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:31.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉唉  皆本那傢伙說今天有重要的任務
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.54,0:01:32.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去偷看一下嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行的  不是告誡過我們絕對不要靠近嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.66,0:01:38.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說不行不是更讓人在意嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.99,0:01:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在做些什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.22,0:03:17.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(730,570)\fad(500,500)}28th  sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.22,0:03:17.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(780,600)\fad(500,500)}「閉月羞花！蕾見警報」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.91,0:03:15.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是什麼特殊的研究設施嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.22,0:03:20.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  終於到了喚醒那位大人的時候了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.63,0:03:21.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那位大人？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.60,0:03:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,指紋認證  確認完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.13,0:03:34.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,視網膜認證  確認完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.64,0:03:43.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Children她們是好孩子！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:48.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,局長  那位大人是？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.66,0:03:51.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是和我們B.A.B.E.L.的創立相關的重臣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.46,0:03:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經睡了差不多十年了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.56,0:03:54.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸  十年？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.90,0:03:55.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.91,0:03:58.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以該說是很難對付還是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.17,0:04:08.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「詛咒所有妨礙我睡眠的人」…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.33,0:04:10.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隨便叫醒她的話似乎會大吵大鬧的…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.07,0:04:13.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是這次沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.02,0:04:16.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不也聽到她的聲音了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.58,0:04:18.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聲音？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:23.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.80,0:04:26.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂  眼鏡君
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.44,0:04:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那個時候的…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:29.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我是桐壺
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.85,0:04:31.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:32.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前幾天真是太感謝您了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根據前任局長的指示  只要少佐一有行動就要來叫醒您…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.82,0:04:39.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}上次累死我了  現在還沒睡夠  你下個月再來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.25,0:04:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃…呃…就算您這麼說…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:41.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.02,0:04:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}再見
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.47,0:04:43.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  等等
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.57,0:04:45.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有叫醒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.26,0:04:48.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…裡面的這位大人和兵部有什麼關係的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:50.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關係大著了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.34,0:04:52.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是那傢伙的前同僚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.48,0:04:53.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同僚？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.72,0:04:55.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是說超過八十歲了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.96,0:04:57.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對兵部少佐的拘束和監禁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.03,0:05:00.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有她的力量是不可能辦到的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:03.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了抑制住P.A.N.D.R.A就必須盡快將她叫醒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.53,0:05:05.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要吵了  會讓人睡不著的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.98,0:05:08.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看…看來心情很不好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.13,0:05:11.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天還是先回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.35,0:05:13.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警告  警告
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.12,0:05:15.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有入侵者  有入侵者
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.91,0:05:17.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.35,0:05:20.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.45,0:05:21.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿嘿  來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.04,0:05:23.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是說過不能來的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.59,0:05:25.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為…想見你嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.02,0:05:28.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生是我的Destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.57,0:05:29.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上出去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:33.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶吶  皆本你也很想見我們的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.45,0:05:34.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.33,0:05:35.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事怎樣都無所謂啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.05,0:05:38.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  怎樣都無所謂？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:42.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本君
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.41,0:05:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是自作自受
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.65,0:05:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.32,0:05:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀  發現好男人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.40,0:05:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是來和我私會的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.64,0:05:53.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你在做什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.59,0:05:55.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的有八十歲嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.53,0:05:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要提年齡啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.20,0:06:00.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得了  皆本先生被女人襲擊了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.38,0:06:02.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸  你在做什麼啊  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.63,0:06:03.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快給我出來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.95,0:06:05.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  住手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.22,0:06:17.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:20.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何…何方神聖
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.16,0:06:22.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您醒了嗎  蕾見不二子管理官
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.76,0:06:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  很清醒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.23,0:06:25.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.39,0:06:26.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼馬上去本部吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.96,0:06:29.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在此之前要先吃早餐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:33.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管理官？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.03,0:06:37.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.32,0:06:38.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.27,0:06:43.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是年輕人啊  被吸了這麼多還這麼有精神
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.85,0:06:47.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  因為這女人的性騷擾  什麼東西變得多麼精神了啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:50.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔…什麼意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.36,0:06:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不清楚～
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.24,0:06:52.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊呀  你們好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.77,0:06:55.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很清楚你們的事哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.09,0:06:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這位小弟的這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.17,0:07:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.41,0:07:01.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這怎麼可能啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.93,0:07:03.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都還只不過是小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.51,0:07:05.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.42,0:07:10.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裡面發生什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.22,0:07:14.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危險  直美
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:17.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了你我願意死無數次
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.42,0:07:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你會因為這點程度就死嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.82,0:07:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  事情大條了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.13,0:07:31.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幹掉了嗎  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:33.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  完全沒有打中的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:38.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是LV7的念動能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.77,0:07:41.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.23,0:07:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.60,0:07:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個人是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.77,0:07:50.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們友好相處吧  明石薰妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.37,0:07:51.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  接觸感應能力？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.55,0:07:55.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.60,0:08:02.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢…慢著…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.63,0:08:09.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:13.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你久等了～
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有等  我完全沒在等
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.13,0:08:21.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.78,0:08:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家  沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.23,0:08:26.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀  美味的點心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.26,0:08:29.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.65,0:08:33.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的初吻…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:36.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且對方據說還是八十歲的老奶奶…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.24,0:08:38.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嫁不出去了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.36,0:08:41.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽  對不起了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.62,0:08:44.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太小題大作了  這只是打招呼而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.24,0:08:45.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通過碰觸而吸取能量的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.34,0:08:52.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從某種意義上來說比兵部少佐還難對付啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.15,0:08:54.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作為同伴還真是亦喜亦悲啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.61,0:09:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我睡眠期間的報告書就這麼多了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.24,0:09:00.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.04,0:09:03.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超能力者和普通人的對立激化嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.17,0:09:06.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不二子  要開始忙碌啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.95,0:09:10.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果需要更詳細的數據的話  請儘管吩咐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.22,0:09:12.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  我有馬上想知道的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.89,0:09:13.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:17.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告訴我你們使用的化妝品～
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.62,0:09:21.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,過了十年  化妝技術也進化了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.22,0:09:26.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種睫毛膏加了珍珠粉  會讓睫毛光華柔順的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.33,0:09:28.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  真可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.54,0:09:30.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是增強眼神力度的睫毛膏
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:33.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這顏色很好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.39,0:09:36.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次再一起聊女生話題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.27,0:09:36.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.83,0:09:41.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真開心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.59,0:09:43.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.23,0:09:47.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愚蠢的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.09,0:09:52.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到現在還盡是憧憬著不可企及的過去和未來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.61,0:09:54.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.67,0:09:59.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的老化停止現象是吸取能量這種能力的副作用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這能力本來的作用是透過吸取的能量來提升自身的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.87,0:10:06.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這能力是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.94,0:10:07.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.09,0:10:08.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.64,0:10:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和The Children一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.55,0:10:12.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管…管理官
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.74,0:10:16.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要條件具備的話  就能達到LV7的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:20.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像是瞬間最大風速這種東西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.11,0:10:24.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,順帶一提  你能叫我不二子妹妹嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.62,0:10:25.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者至少叫我蕾見小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.09,0:10:27.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太…太強人所難了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.30,0:10:30.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外  還有一件事～
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.58,0:10:34.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的初吻
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.94,0:10:37.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能當成是被狗咬了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.23,0:10:38.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:40.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被狗咬了能忘記嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:42.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小葵你太少女了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.23,0:10:43.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過是個吻罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.86,0:10:46.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幻想太美妙的話  真正做的時候可就麻煩了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.19,0:10:49.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出現了  見多了男女間的事的接觸感應能力者的正論
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.51,0:10:52.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫穗  你真的是第一次嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.37,0:10:54.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過  要好好注意那個人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:56.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相當難對付
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:10:59.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那也不能毫不還手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.19,0:11:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且皆本啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.78,0:11:01.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.93,0:11:03.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須要盡早調教
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.77,0:11:05.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸  你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.32,0:11:10.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是說啊  你不要再負責The Children了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.14,0:11:13.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不二子正式命令
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.56,0:11:15.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  這是什麼命令啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:16.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太沒頭沒腦了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.70,0:11:18.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有理由就…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.15,0:11:19.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有理由哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.79,0:11:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按現在這樣下去  The Children最終會變成兵部所期望的那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.77,0:11:26.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵部所期望的？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.85,0:11:28.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是辦不到的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.93,0:11:33.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒有改變命運的力量和覺悟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.14,0:11:40.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}午後は○○。外で遊ぼう！{\r}\N下午是○○  到外面玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.03,0:11:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}うるうるリップ。きゃあ{\r}\N潤滑唇膏  呀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.56,0:11:49.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒有改變命運的力量？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.88,0:11:51.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命運…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.34,0:11:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…什麼意思…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.68,0:12:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不曉得  不二子也不是很清楚～
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.27,0:12:02.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個老太婆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟知道多少…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.76,0:12:08.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  現在就進行部署轉換
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.59,0:12:10.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸  請…請等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.67,0:12:11.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.65,0:12:14.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公務員是不能頂撞命令的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.71,0:12:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ByeBye
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.43,0:12:24.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  接下來流向會怎麼變化呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.93,0:12:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蠻橫的人事變動！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.63,0:12:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.95,0:12:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人事調動？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.13,0:12:36.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  研究開發部突然急需他的幫助
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.09,0:12:38.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.61,0:12:39.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.89,0:12:42.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.88,0:12:44.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這違反了服務規定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.21,0:12:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老實說出來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:47.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那個老奶奶指使的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.84,0:12:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暴力也是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.13,0:12:54.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是局長珍視的盆栽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.14,0:12:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  手滑了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:12:58.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住  住手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:13:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐嚇更加不行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.26,0:13:02.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是不可能接受的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.90,0:13:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  皆本先生和我們約好了的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:07.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會一直和我們在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.49,0:13:09.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白  我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.23,0:13:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是管理官好像也有什麼想法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.09,0:13:14.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盯——
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.78,0:13:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暫時忍耐一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.20,0:13:19.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚點我一定會想辦法的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.75,0:13:21.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚點是什麼時候啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.34,0:13:23.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之現在要忍耐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.77,0:13:26.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實預知課發來了出擊的請求
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.82,0:13:28.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.92,0:13:31.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回來後一定要把這個問題解決掉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.27,0:13:32.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:35.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要和新主任好好執行任務哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.84,0:13:37.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新主任？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.22,0:13:40.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到今早的共同練習的成果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.22,0:13:42.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠如此之快地發揮作用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.27,0:13:46.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼馬上…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.66,0:13:49.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直美 & The Children
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.95,0:13:52.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解禁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.68,0:13:58.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,純淨正確狂野地
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.33,0:14:00.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對有些無法接受
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.66,0:14:02.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  感覺很失望
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:04.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未來在位居高位的人手中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:07.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,秀麗純潔Wild Cat  And…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.40,0:14:08.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.51,0:14:11.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為漏油而導致的油輪大爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.06,0:14:14.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,離事故發生還有三十分鐘以上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:16.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要冷靜處理
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.39,0:14:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.65,0:14:23.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不覺得異常的安靜嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.65,0:14:25.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  沒有人的氣息
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.71,0:14:29.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好奇怪  也沒有漏油的痕跡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.95,0:14:32.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有任何人在
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.43,0:14:34.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.43,0:14:37.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫非是…什麼陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.19,0:14:39.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道說是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.69,0:14:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在等你們哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.21,0:14:49.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  為什麼在這…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.11,0:14:53.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  皆本？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.97,0:14:54.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,賢木
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.53,0:14:57.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你為什麼在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.46,0:15:01.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是醫生嘛  會定期到研究所來的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.71,0:15:03.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  沒想到你…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.43,0:15:04.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  賢木
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:08.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有不是B.A.B.E.L.配備的手機吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:15.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您撥打的號碼被限制通話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.81,0:15:19.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根據國家機密防止法  此電話會自動銷毀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.68,0:15:23.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  這個也不行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.99,0:15:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你要怎麼負責啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.34,0:15:28.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裡面有女孩子的郵件地址啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.00,0:15:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我無法和Children取得聯絡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.67,0:15:33.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都是管理官的所為
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.53,0:15:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管理官？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:36.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是想將我們徹底分離
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.78,0:15:38.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這讓我怎麼能接受啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:41.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和那些孩子都不是國家的所有物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.20,0:15:44.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  雖然我不清楚詳細情況
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.63,0:15:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之你被監視了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.51,0:15:53.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反抗上司的話  不只是開除就能了事的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.97,0:15:58.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逮捕  監禁  該不會連射殺的許可都有了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.99,0:16:05.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了好了  反正有工資拿的  就乖一點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.28,0:16:06.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.43,0:16:17.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.28,0:16:18.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.61,0:16:19.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.38,0:16:23.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.83,0:16:24.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.60,0:16:28.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個影像…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.92,0:16:30.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我的幻想或妄想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.00,0:16:33.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  她們有那麼強的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.96,0:16:36.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傳送來心靈感應也不是什麼不可思議的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.86,0:16:39.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生了什麼事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.24,0:16:40.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然如果現在不去的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.99,0:16:45.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,賢木  幫幫我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.10,0:16:49.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回答我  直美  Children
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.31,0:16:51.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.35,0:16:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  火…火災發生了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.15,0:16:58.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.37,0:17:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,衝進去的那些孩子沒事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.84,0:17:01.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.64,0:17:02.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直美  Children
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.04,0:17:03.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回答我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.11,0:17:06.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了  回答我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.08,0:17:13.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這混帳
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.46,0:17:15.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀  為什麼生氣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.76,0:17:17.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還以為你們會高興的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:18.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.89,0:17:21.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這傢伙  果然是敵人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.33,0:17:22.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接招
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.86,0:17:35.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.23,0:17:37.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你竟敢…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.07,0:17:41.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別小看我們
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.38,0:17:48.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還要打嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.06,0:17:50.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.30,0:17:52.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要露出這麼可怕的表情嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.53,0:17:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是為你們著想才這麼做的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.35,0:17:56.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在睜眼說瞎話嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.10,0:17:58.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.69,0:18:02.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼作為我是你們同伴的證據  我告訴你們一件非常重大的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.36,0:18:05.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本君  現在正在朝這邊趕來哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.81,0:18:08.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  照我說的做
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.69,0:18:12.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然的話  我就把他給幹掉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.74,0:18:16.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀  救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.72,0:18:20.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使違背命令也要來救你們
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.62,0:18:21.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.05,0:18:26.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  他因為擔心你們胸口都快要撕裂了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.48,0:18:29.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過  不覺得有一個問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.61,0:18:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,問題？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.77,0:18:33.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對他來說Children只是小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.74,0:18:35.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是好像妹妹一樣的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.53,0:18:38.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然  再過數年可能就會察覺
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.00,0:18:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些孩子也是美妙的女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.67,0:18:44.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  這樣就太晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.78,0:18:49.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家  在哪裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.91,0:18:52.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,振作點
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.48,0:18:54.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.98,0:18:57.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.06,0:19:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.79,0:19:02.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…已經不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.99,0:19:04.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會有這種事的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.23,0:19:05.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我馬上帶你們去醫院
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.29,0:19:07.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…就這樣抱著我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.15,0:19:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像戀人一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.39,0:19:11.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了  就算只有現在這點時間也好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.22,0:19:13.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是只有現在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.81,0:19:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迄今為止都是  今後也一直是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.45,0:19:17.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戀人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.60,0:19:18.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:19.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:20.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.50,0:19:22.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我太蠢了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.04,0:19:25.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在快要失去的時候  才第一次意識到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.73,0:19:29.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我將你作為一名女性去愛你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.46,0:19:35.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃…等一下  剛才的流向不覺得太勉強嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.44,0:19:36.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才沒這回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.50,0:19:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直美～
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.11,0:19:44.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的直美～
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.03,0:19:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在快要失去你的時候我意識到了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.45,0:19:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我將你作為一名女性愛著…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.95,0:19:52.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.63,0:19:55.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙是例外  例外
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.85,0:19:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這樣  絕對會順利的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.11,0:20:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要加油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:01.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.99,0:20:10.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蕾見管理官
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.18,0:20:11.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.67,0:20:14.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然違背我不二子的命令來到這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.70,0:20:19.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就清楚地告訴我你的心意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.22,0:20:23.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和Children不是只透過工作相連的關係
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在需要的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.04,0:20:29.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以改變命運的強大的愛的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.48,0:20:33.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎麼可能因為一個命令就和她們分開啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.59,0:20:35.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.53,0:20:39.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算很微小  只要有種子的話我就會將它培育起來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.70,0:20:43.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  問題在於那些孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.34,0:20:51.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還差點真實性啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.21,0:20:54.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.05,0:20:57.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…在做什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.91,0:20:58.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.72,0:20:59.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.98,0:21:01.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還在準備啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.51,0:21:03.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  小孩真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.03,0:21:07.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  檢查的結果…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.39,0:21:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Children…連擦傷都沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.28,0:21:10.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.04,0:21:11.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.92,0:21:13.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過  沒事真是太好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.73,0:21:15.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.85,0:21:17.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大團圓啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.18,0:21:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果就是說大家一起在耍我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.94,0:21:24.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…我只是遵從命令…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.19,0:21:25.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  不要這麼生氣嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.13,0:21:27.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生也不對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.95,0:21:31.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  整天都說我們小孩子小孩子的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.57,0:21:32.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我願意原諒你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.13,0:21:34.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就當作是彼此彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.75,0:21:36.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  所以這件事就到此結束
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.00,0:21:38.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別開玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.22,0:21:40.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在執行重要任務的時候你們都在做些什麼啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.39,0:21:43.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且  還半開玩笑地玩弄我擔心你們的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.96,0:21:45.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們把我…不對
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.95,0:21:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把這工作當成什麼了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.92,0:21:50.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想做這種事情的話  就去找其他負責人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.29,0:21:53.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  皆本…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.59,0:21:54.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我  已經夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.94,0:21:55.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要辭職
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.96,0:21:57.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種工作我不做了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.58,0:22:02.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生  我明白你的感受…冷靜點
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.05,0:22:03.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會和管理官好好談談的…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.98,0:22:04.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.51,0:22:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.76,0:22:08.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.94,0:23:42.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下回的絕對可憐Children是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.01,0:23:44.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.51,0:23:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這片海是伊號喜歡的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.71,0:23:47.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊號喜歡的？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.39,0:23:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊號沒事就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.02,0:23:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話  就能證明那悲慘的未來並不是絕對的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.65,0:23:55.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您全都知道了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.61,0:23:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.24,0:24:00.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第29話  「花言巧語！離天國最近的大海」
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.06,0:24:03.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初次見面  我是未摘花江
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.14,0:24:05.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼能馬上將這孩子洗腦嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.93,0:24:06.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.75,0:24:08.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐  所以不會輸！
